<title>USA: Brightpoint names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Friday it named J. Mark Howell, chief financial officer, as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>As president, he replaces Robert Laikin, who continues as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Howell, who joined the company as chief financial officer in July 1994, is also a board member.  </p>
<p>Brightpoint, which distributes wireless communication equpment, said Phillip Bounsall joined the company has chief financial officer. He had been chief financial officer of WalkerInformation Inc.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
